cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "docking985: a peptide–protein re-docking benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A curated dataset of 985 peptide–protein X-ray/NMR complexes, drawn from seven published
  peptide-docking benchmarks and filtered to a consistent quality bar, with a scoring library for
  evaluating predicted docking poses against the native structures.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Receptor.AI, Inc."
    website: "https://receptor.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/receptor-ai-peptide-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/receptor-ai-peptide-benchmarks"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
keywords:
  - peptides
  - protein-peptide docking
  - benchmark
  - drug discovery
